<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">ずっと真夜中でいいのに。 (永远是深夜有多好｡)</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>ACAね</songwriter><songwriter>Mori Calliope</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">迎合周遭的圆滑话术皆一概不知</text><text for="L2">虽然不堪一击 但直觉敏锐</text><text for="L3">姑且先主动进攻 再适时停止</text><text for="L4">暂且先像棉花一般 即使遭受挤压弯折</text><text for="L5">也会继续向上膨胀 荡漾摇曳</text><text for="L6">却又立刻招来麻烦 过度呼吸与心得体会</text><text for="L7">所谓人生即是原罪 充斥自相矛盾</text><text for="L8">内心纠葛则是必经之路</text><text for="L9">必须得就此结束一切 否则话语将无限增殖</text><text for="L10">大脑一片空白 宛如空虚圆阵</text><text for="L11">在混乱与静谧之中 为你献上</text><text for="L12">必须要完成意欲放弃之事</text><text for="L13">否则我便无法得到满足</text><text for="L14">很震撼 不是吗?</text><text for="L15">“梦想的人生?” 你正过着呢</text><text for="L16">“只是打工的话哪里都可以啊?”</text><text for="L17">璀璨闪耀</text><text for="L18">所谓厌恶只是开端</text><text for="L19">只要这么想 就能乐得自在</text><text for="L20">3 2 1 一同陷入扭曲疯狂</text><text for="L21">你的唇齿之间 传来香烟的刺鼻气息</text><text for="L22">即使早已与你划清界限 (不管三七二十一 将汁液一饮而尽 我们仍然顽强)</text><text for="L23">既是最糟糕的聚集物 也是最美味的海带</text><text for="L24">如果全都井井有条 该有多么乏味无趣</text><text for="L25">就算相互连结 也会破绽百出</text><text for="L26">鲣鱼干吃起来也咸涩不堪</text><text for="L27">但还想品尝更加甜蜜的宠溺?</text><text for="L28">潦草粗糙却也跌宕起伏的现状</text><text for="L29">正在当下火爆流行</text><text for="L30">经历挫折才能推动进步的理论</text><text for="L31">摇摆不定上下起伏的成长仍差点火候</text><text for="L32">真想置身于底层的巅峰</text><text for="L33">通过优越感得到自我满足</text><text for="L34">我不想再写歌 也不想再拿起麦克风</text><text for="L35">反馈声曾让我止步</text><text for="L36">我跌落谷底 只能买廉价咖啡</text><text for="L37">以为音乐类型的时代早已远去</text><text for="L38">谢谢你 你的歌曲很对我胃口</text><text for="L39">但我已经没有希望了 远远不够</text><text for="L40">像扔过期罐头一样甩出歌词</text><text for="L41">平凡小孩野心膨胀 我已经完了</text><text for="L42">在互联网上散播怨言 又擅自修改规则</text><text for="L43">磨蹭懒散 精神过敏</text><text for="L44">这般的负面想法充斥脑海</text><text for="L45">没有人回应 我仍喊着“红罗孚” （什么？）</text><text for="L46">并非每句歌词都能命中</text><text for="L47">“我想念”的瞬间</text><text for="L48">做个无名之辈 因为没有人拥有善意</text><text for="L49">应该彻底懈怠自我 在所有人面前</text><text for="L50">也许该回到无人知晓的我</text><text for="L51">知道吗？</text><text for="L52">算了</text><text for="L53">宏大蓝图之中 梦想从不需安眠药</text><text for="L54">与“咸涩的梦境”就此作别</text><text for="L55">能遇到你真是太好了</text><text for="L56">辉煌闪耀</text><text for="L57">所谓厌恶只是开端</text><text for="L58">只要这么想 就能乐得自在</text><text for="L59">数3 2 1 一同陷入扭曲疯狂</text><text for="L60">你的唇齿之间 传来香烟的刺鼻气息</text><text for="L61">即使早已与你划清界限 (不管三七二十一  将汁液一饮而尽 我们仍然顽强)</text><text for="L62">既是最糟糕的聚集物 也是最美味的海带</text><text for="L63">如果全都井井有条 该有多么乏味无趣</text><text for="L64">就算相互连结 也会破绽百出</text><text for="L65">鲣鱼干吃起来也咸涩不堪</text><text for="L66">但还想品尝更加甜蜜的宠溺?</text><text for="L67">心无旁骛摇曳起舞</text><text for="L68">心无旁骛摇曳起舞</text><text for="L69">心无旁骛摇曳起舞</text><text for="L70">心无旁骛摇曳起舞</text><text for="L71">初出茅庐的鲁莽冲动 就在此处</text><text for="L72">看似学有所成</text><text for="L73">声音却仍然懵懂无知</text><text for="L74">超过保质期的孤寂腐朽</text><text for="L75">也能全部接纳</text><text for="L76">虽然想要向你展现最真实的自我</text><text for="L77">但你已经无比厌倦 就将其作为食粮</text><text for="L78">充斥阴郁的黑暗能量</text><text for="L79">总能助我一臂之力</text><text for="L80">璀璨闪耀</text><text for="L81">罗刹鬼魅</text><text for="L82">所谓厌恶只是开端</text><text for="L83">只要这么想 就能乐得自在</text><text for="L84">3 2 1 一同陷入扭曲疯狂</text><text for="L85">你的唇齿之间 传来香烟的刺鼻气息</text><text for="L86">即使早已与你划清界限 (我才不管呢 如果心中明了 将其一饮而尽 我们仍然顽强)</text><text for="L87">永远都是人生的研究生 价值如同小行星</text><text for="L88">不必强求驾驭一切</text><text for="L89">与你产生胜利的共鸣 咬下一口便会发出声响</text><text for="L90">但还想品尝更加甜蜜的宠溺?</text><text for="L91">心无旁骛摇曳起舞</text><text for="L92">心无旁骛摇曳起舞</text><text for="L93">心无旁骛摇曳起舞</text><text for="L94">心无旁骛摇曳起舞</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="0:14.359" end="0:16.117" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.359" end="0:14.548">周</span><span begin="0:14.548" end="0:14.620">り</span><span begin="0:14.620" end="0:14.716">に</span><span begin="0:14.716" end="0:14.804">合</span><span begin="0:14.804" end="0:14.892">わ</span><span begin="0:14.892" end="0:14.985">せ</span><span begin="0:14.985" end="0:15.124">る</span><span begin="0:15.124" end="0:15.367">言</span><span begin="0:15.367" end="0:15.481">語</span><span begin="0:15.481" end="0:15.592">も</span><span begin="0:15.592" end="0:15.649">知</span><span begin="0:15.649" end="0:15.833">ら</span><span begin="0:15.833" end="0:15.881">ね</span><span begin="0:15.882" end="0:16.117">え</span></p><p begin="0:16.117" end="0:17.862" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.117" end="0:16.274">守</span><span begin="0:16.274" end="0:16.548">備</span><span begin="0:16.548" end="0:16.721">力</span><span begin="0:16.721" end="0:16.810">は</span><span begin="0:16.810" end="0:16.992">弱</span><span begin="0:16.992" end="0:17.060">い</span><span begin="0:17.060" end="0:17.148">け</span><span begin="0:17.148" end="0:17.229">ど</span><span begin="0:17.229" end="0:17.347">勘</span><span begin="0:17.347" end="0:17.458">は</span><span begin="0:17.458" end="0:17.862">鋭</span></p><p begin="0:17.862" end="0:19.483" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.862" end="0:18.040">一</span><span begin="0:18.040" end="0:18.156">旦</span><span begin="0:18.156" end="0:18.439">進</span><span begin="0:18.439" end="0:18.528">め</span><span begin="0:18.528" end="0:18.620">ら</span><span begin="0:18.620" end="0:18.704">れ</span><span begin="0:18.704" end="0:18.790">た</span><span begin="0:18.790" end="0:18.871">ら</span><span begin="0:18.871" end="0:18.971">止</span><span begin="0:18.971" end="0:19.157">ま</span><span begin="0:19.157" end="0:19.483">れ</span></p><p begin="0:19.483" end="0:20.953" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.483" end="0:19.561">い</span><span begin="0:19.561" end="0:19.639">っ</span><span begin="0:19.640" end="0:19.720">た</span><span begin="0:19.720" end="0:19.800">ん</span><span begin="0:19.801" end="0:19.930">木</span><span begin="0:19.930" end="0:20.113">綿</span><span begin="0:20.113" end="0:20.191">み</span><span begin="0:20.191" end="0:20.348">た</span><span begin="0:20.348" end="0:20.620">い</span><span begin="0:20.620" end="0:20.953">に</span></p><p begin="0:20.953" end="0:22.864" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:20.953" end="0:21.068">曲</span><span begin="0:21.068" end="0:21.176">が</span><span begin="0:21.176" end="0:21.260">れ</span><span begin="0:21.260" end="0:21.368">ま</span><span begin="0:21.368" end="0:21.489">だ</span><span begin="0:21.489" end="0:21.942">上</span> <span begin="0:21.942" end="0:22.030">ゆ</span><span begin="0:22.030" end="0:22.114">ら</span><span begin="0:22.114" end="0:22.202">ゆ</span><span begin="0:22.202" end="0:22.288">ら</span><span begin="0:22.288" end="0:22.375">揺</span><span begin="0:22.375" end="0:22.456">ら</span><span begin="0:22.456" end="0:22.536">し</span><span begin="0:22.536" end="0:22.864">て</span></p><p begin="0:22.864" end="0:24.715" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:22.864" end="0:23.048">す</span><span begin="0:23.048" end="0:23.157">ぐ</span><span begin="0:23.157" end="0:23.233">と</span><span begin="0:23.233" end="0:23.329">ら</span><span begin="0:23.329" end="0:23.413">ぶ</span><span begin="0:23.413" end="0:23.500">る</span><span begin="0:23.500" end="0:23.592">ぜ</span> <span begin="0:23.592" end="0:24.017">過呼吸</span><span begin="0:24.017" end="0:24.108">と</span><span begin="0:24.108" end="0:24.372">心</span><span begin="0:24.372" end="0:24.715">得</span></p><p begin="0:24.715" end="0:26.462" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:24.715" end="0:24.826">っ</span><span begin="0:24.826" end="0:24.901">て</span><span begin="0:24.901" end="0:25.051">原</span><span begin="0:25.051" end="0:25.253">罪</span><span begin="0:25.253" end="0:25.353">人</span><span begin="0:25.353" end="0:25.526">生</span> <span begin="0:25.613" end="0:25.849">盾</span><span begin="0:25.849" end="0:25.929">と</span><span begin="0:25.929" end="0:26.155">矛</span><span begin="0:26.155" end="0:26.462">で</span></p><p begin="0:26.462" end="0:28.243" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:26.462" end="0:26.584">葛</span><span begin="0:26.584" end="0:26.719">藤</span><span begin="0:26.719" end="0:26.927">の</span><span begin="0:26.927" end="0:27.267">活</span><span begin="0:27.267" end="0:27.367">動</span><span begin="0:27.367" end="0:27.463">が</span><span begin="0:27.463" end="0:27.615">マ</span><span begin="0:27.615" end="0:27.779">ス</span><span begin="0:27.779" end="0:28.243">ト</span></p><p begin="0:28.420" end="0:31.331" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.420" end="0:28.582">締</span><span begin="0:28.582" end="0:28.747">め</span><span begin="0:28.747" end="0:28.956">切</span><span begin="0:28.956" end="0:29.158">ら</span><span begin="0:29.158" end="0:29.315">れ</span><span begin="0:29.315" end="0:29.463">な</span><span begin="0:29.463" end="0:29.523">き</span><span begin="0:29.523" end="0:29.583">ゃ</span><span begin="0:29.583" end="0:29.918">言</span><span begin="0:29.918" end="0:30.108">葉</span><span begin="0:30.108" end="0:30.323">が</span><span begin="0:30.323" end="0:30.587">増</span><span begin="0:30.587" end="0:31.331">殖</span></p><p begin="0:31.331" end="0:33.124" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.331" end="0:31.494">No</span> <span begin="0:31.494" end="0:31.685">thoughts</span> <span begin="0:31.685" end="0:31.864">head</span> <span begin="0:31.864" end="0:32.027">empty</span> <span begin="0:32.027" end="0:32.292">虚</span><span begin="0:32.292" end="0:32.435">無</span><span begin="0:32.435" end="0:32.518">で</span><span begin="0:32.518" end="0:32.685">円</span><span begin="0:32.685" end="0:33.124">陣</span></p><p begin="0:33.124" end="0:34.072" itunes:key="L